.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Aug 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-customers-projected-usage - Retrieve customer current and projected usage


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago customers projected-usage  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint enables the retrieval of the usage-based billing data for a customer within the current period. It also returns the projected usage for the current period based on the current usage.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--apply-taxes\fP=""
	Optional flag to determine if taxes should be applied. Defaults to 'true' if not provided or if null.

.PP
\fB--external-subscription-id\fP=""
	The unique identifier of the subscription within your application.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for projected-usage

.PP
\fB--watch\fP[=false]
	Poll and re-render when the response changes

.PP
\fB--watch-interval\fP=2s
	Polling interval used with --watch


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
